    "description": "The Logistics Shipments ETA API provides real-time estimated time of arrival (ETA) information for shipments within the logistics framework. This resource allows users to query and retrieve the ETA details of their ongoing or planned shipments, facilitating enhanced operational planning and customer communication. Typical consumers of this API include logistics managers, supply chain professionals, and customer service teams looking to optimize delivery schedules and improve service levels. The API seamlessly integrates with logistics platforms to deliver accurate ETA data, driving efficiency and transparency in shipping operations.",
